{
  "name": "Know Your Enemy",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your keen sense of observation allows you to spot weaknesses in your foe's defense. As a Bonus Action, you can make a Wisdom (Insight) check against a creature you can see within 60 feet. The DC is equal to 10 + half the creature's challenge rating (rounded down) or the creature's passive deception, whichever is higher. On a success, the creature has Disadvantage on the next Saving Throw against one of your maneuvers before the end of your next turn.</p>",
